{"name": "Dual Core Sync", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/e7e6ee5a73cdfa9c7971974c2828b790.avif?t=1782737836\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\"Dual Core Sync\"</strong> is a high-difficulty, <strong>brain-splitting</strong> game that forces <strong>single players</strong> to handle <strong>\"two-player co-op\"</strong> mechanics solo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your left and right hands are allies, but also each other's worst enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"112\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/1411fc0863893ac9e48f368dceba49b5.avif?t=1782737836\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A \"two-player\" game designed for solo play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You must drive two independent robots <strong>simultaneously</strong>, seeking a sliver of hope through a gauntlet of traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Failure often happens because you couldn\u2019t stop your hand from pressing the key meant for the <strong>other side of your brain</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Includes 100 meticulously crafted levels:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Danger escalates at every turn. Your margin for error is <strong>zero</strong>. One slip, and <strong>both cores are wrecked</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Highly Challenging Achievements:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Includes advanced goals far more rigorous than simple game completion. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Only a true <strong>\"Dual Core Master\"</strong> can unlock every medal representing ultimate skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Solo play is the standard challenge, but local co-op is also supported:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Endure this \"mental split\" alone, or bring a friend and find out exactly who is <strong>dragging the team down</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/135e29e3772c7e0726bfb873b3a2a127.poster.avif?t=1782737836\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/135e29e3772c7e0726bfb873b3a2a127.webm?t=1782737836\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/135e29e3772c7e0726bfb873b3a2a127.mp4?t=1782737836\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/a6236f23e7e5ea90ef3da6e5e566d8ca.poster.avif?t=1782737836\" width=\"600\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4536280/extras/a6236f23e7e5ea90ef3da6e5e566d8ca.webm?t=1782737836\" type=\"video/